sequence Sign in with a one-time code
legend-inline

tag Concern as c
  Auth blue
  Email orange

User
WebApp
AuthAPI
SessionDB

User -enter your email-> WebApp
WebApp -POST /code-> AuthAPI c: Auth
AuthAPI -store the challenge-> SessionDB c: Auth
AuthAPI ~six digits, valid 10 min~> User c: Email
User -enter the code-> WebApp
WebApp -POST /verify-> AuthAPI c: Auth
AuthAPI -mark verified-> SessionDB c: Auth
AuthAPI -session cookie-> User c: Auth
